rm</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=2^{x-a}+b\" data-display=\"true\"></span><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.24/questions/assets/diagrams/q3a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.24/questions/assets/diagrams/q3b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.24/questions/assets/diagrams/q3c.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2^{x-a}+4\" data-display=\"false\"></span><br> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(0,\\frac{17}{4}):\\frac{17}{4}=2^{-a}+4\\Rightarrow2^{-a}=\\frac14\\Rightarrow2^{-a}=2^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span><br> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow a=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span><br> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2^{x-2}+4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2^{x-a}-4\" data-display=\"false\"></span><br> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(0,-2):-2=2^{-a}-4\\Rightarrow2^{-a}=2\\Rightarrow a=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span><br> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2^{x+1}-4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2^{x-a}-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span><br> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(0,7):7=2^{-a}-1\\Rightarrow2^{-a}=8\\Rightarrow a=-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span><br> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2^{x+3}-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.24-q4","number":4,"question":"<p>Sketch the following graphs, identifying where they intersect the coordinate axes and the equations of any asymptotes:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2^{x-4}-4\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=3^{x+2}+2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.24/solutions/assets/diagrams/s4a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.24/solutions/assets/diagrams/s4b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.24-q5","number":5,"question":"<p>Find the equation of each of the following graphs in the form</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=2^{a-x}+b\" data-display=\"true\"></span><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.24/questions/assets/diagrams/q5a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.24/questions/assets/diagrams/q5b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.24/questions/assets/diagrams/q5c.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2^{a-x}+2\" data-display=\"false\"></span><br> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(0,6):6=2^a+2\\Rightarrow2^a=4\\Rightarrow a=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span><br> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2^{2-x}+2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2^{a-x}-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span><br> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(0,6):6=2^a-2\\Rightarrow2^a=8\\Rightarrow a=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span><br> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2^{3-x}-2\" data-display=\"false\"></spa