1,"question":"<p>Find the equation of each of the following graphs in the form</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=\\log_2 x+b\" data-display=\"true\"></span><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.24/questions/assets/diagrams/q11a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.24/questions/assets/diagrams/q11b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.24/questions/assets/diagrams/q11c.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\log_2 x+b\" data-display=\"false\"></span><br> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(\\frac12,0):0=\\log_2\\frac12+b\\Rightarrow0=-1+b\\Rightarrow b=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span><br> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\log_2 x+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\log_2 x+b\" data-display=\"false\"></span><br> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(4,0):0=\\log_2 4+b\\Rightarrow0=2+b\\Rightarrow b=-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span><br> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\log_2 x-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\log_2 x+b\" data-display=\"false\"></span><br> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(\\frac{\\sqrt2}2,0):0=\\log_2\\frac{\\sqrt2}2+b\\Rightarrow0=-\\frac12+b\\Rightarrow b=\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span><br> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\log_2 x+\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.24-q12","number":12,"question":"<p>Sketch the following graphs, identifying where they intersect the coordinate axes and the equations of any asymptotes:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\log_5 x-5\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\log_3 x+4\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.24/solutions/assets/diagrams/s12a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.24/solutions/assets/diagrams/s12b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.24-q13","number":13,"question":"<p>Find the equation of each of the following graphs in the form</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=\\log_2(x-a)+b\" data-display=\"true\"></span><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.24/questions/assets/diagrams/q13a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.24/questions/assets/diagrams/q13b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.24/questions/assets/diagrams/q13c.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\log_2(x-2)+b\" data-display=\"false\"></span><br> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(4,0):0=\\log_2(2)+b\\Rightarrow0=1+b\\Rightarrow b=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span><br> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\log_2(x-2)-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\log_2(x+4)+b\" data-display=\"false\"></span><br> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(0,5):5=\\log_2 4+b\\Rightarrow5=2+b\\Rightarrow b=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span><br> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\log_2(x+4)+3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\log_2(x+1)+b\" data-display=\"false\"></span><br> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(0,-3):-3=\\log_2 1+b\\Rightarrow b=-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span><br> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\log_2(x+1)-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.24-q14","number":14,"question":"<p>Sketch the following graphs, identifying where they intersect the coordinate axes and the equations of any asymptotes:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\log_4(x-2)+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\log_3(x+3)-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.24/solutions/assets/diagrams/s14a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.24/solutions/assets/diagrams/s14b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.24-q15","number":15,"question":"<p>Find the equation of the following graph in the form</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=\\log_2(a-x)+b\" data-display=\"true\"></span><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.24/questions/assets/diagrams/q15.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\log_2(4-x)+b\" data-display=\"false\"></span><br> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(0,5):5=\\log_2 4+b\\Rightarrow b=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span><br> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\log_2(4-x)+3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.24-q16","number":16,"question":"<p>Sketch the following graphs, identifyi